@startuml
title SplitSmart System Context (proposed)
left to right direction
actor "Individual user" as User
actor "Group organizer" as Organizer
actor "Expense approver" as Approver
rectangle "SplitSmart product" {
 component "Java Swing MVP\n(desktop slice)" as Swing
 component "Shared service\n(proposed complete product)" as Service
}
actor "Web client" as Web
actor "Android client" as Android
actor "iOS client" as IOS
cloud "Identity / email\nprovider (unselected)" as Identity
cloud "Private receipt\nstorage (proposed)" as Receipt
cloud "Notification delivery\n(unselected)" as Notify
User --> Swing : MVP use
User --> Web : complete product
User --> Android
User --> IOS
Organizer --> Service : manage group
Approver --> Service : review expense
Web --> Service
Android --> Service
IOS --> Service
Service --> Identity : authenticate / recover
Service --> Receipt : private authorized content
Service --> Notify : post-commit notices
note bottom of Service
No backend, API, provider, or client is verified as implemented.
end note
@enduml
